#: ../../../file_formats.rst:15
msgid ""
"This document describes the versioned file formats that Spack uses to store "
"concrete specs, installation records, and the state of environments. It is "
"intended for developers who modify the data that Spack writes to disk or to "
"a build cache."
msgstr ""

