msgid ""
"A limited set of recent versions is read, see :doc:`file_formats/database`. "
"Older versions are an error that requests ``spack reindex``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../file_formats.rst:139
msgid ""
"Rewritten only by an explicit ``spack reindex``, which creates a backup. "
"Writes to an index in an older version are refused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../file_formats.rst:141 ../../../file_formats.rst:160
msgid "Lockfile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../file_formats.rst:145
msgid ""
"Rewritten when the content of the environment changes. Lockfiles before v4 "
"are rewritten on the next write, and v1 lockfiles are backed up first."
msgstr ""

